></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">没想到来了这么多人！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/005-27278fdb78.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/005-27278fdb78.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n来了三千多人！\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n内容方面也是\n每次彩排都\n一起商量\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n总之\n\n希望大家都能享受其中\n\n希望大家都能开心\n\n就这样不断增加、删减\n反复推敲重做\n\n<br>\n\n\n接下来就只要努力了！\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">然后正式开始！！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">增田和皮卡丘一起登台！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/006-0190ac1fe6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/006-0190ac1fe6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/007-3f47d5e6ce.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/007-3f47d5e6ce.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"868\" height=\"478\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">一开始</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">先从1991年的增田</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">以及当时的GAME FREAK</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">聊起！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">接着聊到</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">1994年的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">《宝可梦 红·绿》</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">开发期间的故事</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/008-c0fda947e4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/008-c0fda947e4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"504\" height=\"265\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n红·绿的对战\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/009-1b7d67b9c9.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/009-1b7d67b9c9.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n和被选中的You tuber Newtiteuf先生对战！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n还聊到了梦幻\n也聊到了钻石·珍珠时代的故事\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/010-066567619e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/010-066567619e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"684\" height=\"475\"></a></figure>\n\n我独自一人去里昂的时候\n            <br>\n\n\n在推特上发了消息\n结果有很多粉丝聚集过来\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n等等……\n\n<br>\n\n\n讲了许许多多的回忆\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n以法国为主题的\n《宝可梦 X·Y》开发秘闻！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/011-0f769b0d67.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/011-0f769b0d67.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n法国风情十足的\n道路两侧树木与洒落的阳光\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/012-fe4447a5a8.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/012-fe4447a5a8.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"504\" height=\"265\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n            关于亲密度培养\n一边看着当时的笔记\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n还聊了作曲的故事\n以及《宝可梦 走吧》！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/013-d55f868fe7.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/013-d55f868fe7.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"504\" height=\"265\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n播放《宝可梦 走吧》的\n音乐……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n在舞台上\n走起了台步（笑）\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/014-fac8b89cfb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/014-fac8b89cfb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n居然……掌声雷动（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n当然\n也聊了《宝可梦 太阳·月亮》！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/015-ba1a42d4fe.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/015-ba1a42d4fe.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n开发中的三只毛绒玩偶\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/016-762ba19bb7.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/016-762ba19bb7.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n而且在这里全球首次公开！\n夜盗火蜥！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n还展示了增田为《太阳·月亮》对战创作的\n一首未采用曲目（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n一边向大家道别\n一边赠送签名精灵球！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/017-6edc447812.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/017-6edc447812.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n能有这么多人前来\n大家似乎也玩得很开心\n真的太好了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n再次感谢\n\n<br>\n\n\nJapan Expo 2016\nNintendo 大师课\n前来参加的各位\n真的非常感谢！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n还有从日本\n为我们加油的大家\n谢谢你们！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！\n<br></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">初ジャパンエキスポ</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/001-fdbae94c66.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/001-fdbae94c66.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">この巨大スクリーンの前で</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ポケモンを語る今回のイベント！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/002-ffbf7f5773.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4800598/002-ff